DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
20794::$$$message_0166_0000_0000$$$::I don't have any business at the church.[lr]::
20795::$$$message_0166_0000_0001$$$::No unfinished business at all. [move textoff=0 time=300 path=(0,0,255)(0,0,0) storage=fd12 accel=0]Not for Shirou Emiya.::
20796::$$$message_0166_0001_0000$$$::"...I can afford to take a detour or two after all this time, right?"[lr]::
20797::$$$message_0166_0001_0001$$$::It'll only waste a little bit of time.[lr]::
20798::$$$message_0166_0001_0002$$$::All these events piling up are starting to take a toll on my mind and body.[lr]::
20799::$$$message_0166_0001_0003$$$::It isn't the most productive kind of motivation, but maybe I'll have her share some of her energy with me again.::
20800::$$$message_0166_0002_0000$$$::"...Huh?"[lr]::
20801::$$$message_0166_0002_0001$$$::The hymn abruptly stops.[lr]::
20802::$$$message_0166_0002_0002$$$::Caren stares at me, like she's seen a ghost.::
20803::$$$message_0166_0003_0000$$$::"...What'd you stop for? You've never done that before."[lr]::
20804::$$$message_0166_0003_0001$$$::[se volume=50 storage=se040.wav][shock vmax=20 time=800 count=2]I return her stare with a glance and take my usual place on the pew.[lr]::
20805::$$$message_0166_0003_0002$$$::I've grown fond of the long bench after all this time.::
20806::$$$message_0166_0004_0000$$$::"Hey, what about the rest? Don't mind me, just keep playing like you always do. I'll wait till you're done."[lr]::
20807::$$$message_0166_0004_0001$$$::I jeer.::
20808::$$$message_0166_0005_0000$$$::"W-well.[lr]::
20809::$$$message_0166_0005_0001$$$::If you want to talk, I'll be right there."[lr]::
20810::$$$message_0166_0005_0002$$$::...That's unusual. Does this cold-blooded girl actually possess the ability to be considerate?[lr]::
20811::$$$message_0166_0005_0003$$$::I wish she could've shown that once or twice before now.[lr]::
20812::$$$message_0166_0005_0004$$$::Right now, it just makes me uncomfortable.[lr]::
20813::$$$message_0166_0005_0005$$$::I'd better teach her how to read the room the next time I get a chance.::
20814::$$$message_0166_0006_0000$$$::"No thanks. I'm tired, so I need to get frustrated. You don't have to worry about me, just keep going."[lr]::
20815::$$$message_0166_0006_0001$$$::"...I will, then. But what is this about?"[lr]::
20816::$$$message_0166_0006_0002$$$::Oh? She didn't like the way I put that, did she?::
20817::$$$message_0166_0007_0000$$$::"It'll wake me up.[lr]::
20818::$$$message_0166_0007_0001$$$::Your organ-playing's just the recharge I need. It gives me a ripping headache."[lr]::
20819::$$$message_0166_0007_0002$$$::Caren turns back to the organ, looking disgruntled.[lr]::
20820::$$$message_0166_0007_0003$$$::It sounds like she doesn't understand the connection between my temper and my headache.::
20821::$$$message_0166_0008_0000$$$::Anyway, she starts playing again.[lr]::
20822::$$$message_0166_0008_0001$$$::The nonexistent organ roars back to life.[wt canskip=0][current withback=false][lr]::
20823::$$$message_0166_0008_0002$$$::Her thin, scarred fingers touch the keys.[lr]::
20824::$$$message_0166_0008_0003$$$::I listen to the ear-grating hymn fill the chapel for the fourth time.::
20825::$$$message_0166_0009_0000$$$::Then, I realize something's different from before.[lr]::
20826::$$$message_0166_0009_0001$$$::Is there more...passion in the performance?[lr]::
20827::$$$message_0166_0009_0002$$$::The sound waves were just vaguely irritating before, but now they blatantly assault my auditory nerves.[lr]::
20828::$$$message_0166_0009_0003$$$::Like nails on a chalkboard.[lr]::
20829::$$$message_0166_0009_0004$$$::Deep irritation turns into anger, and before long, my ostentatious intellect begins to melt.[wm canskip=0]::
20830::$$$message_0166_0010_0000$$$::                                [font italic=true]"...Don't you find anything beautiful?"[font italic=false]::
20831::$$$message_0166_0011_0000$$$::She said something like that to me, once.[lr]::
20832::$$$message_0166_0011_0001$$$::If I ever had such feelings, they're long gone.[lr]::
20833::$$$message_0166_0011_0002$$$::I'm at ease now.[lr]::
20834::$$$message_0166_0011_0003$$$::I just exist as I am, watching the world as it is.[lr]::
20835::$$$message_0166_0011_0004$$$::Personal sentiment is just too heavy, y'know?[lr]::
20836::$$$message_0166_0011_0005$$$::And yet, why...?[wm canskip=0]::
20837::$$$message_0166_0012_0000$$$::                                   [wait canskip=0 time=1000]...Don't fuck with me.::
20838::$$$message_0166_0013_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
20839::$$$message_0166_0013_0001$$$::I catch a glimpse of an unfamiliar scene.[lr]::
20840::$$$message_0166_0013_0002$$$::I don't understand what it means.[lr]::
20841::$$$message_0166_0013_0003$$$::A barren wasteland. The air is thin, and the ground is far below.[lr]::
20842::$$$message_0166_0013_0004$$$::Why...why am I remembering this now?::
20843::$$$message_0166_0014_0000$$$::These invasive thoughts I can't get rid of.[lr]::
20844::$$$message_0166_0014_0001$$$::I'm haunted by more than just loathing.[lr]::
20845::$$$message_0166_0014_0002$$$::This very scene is seared into my eyes.::
20846::$$$message_0166_0015_0000$$$::...Gimme a break.[lr]::
20847::$$$message_0166_0015_0001$$$::Why am I remembering this?[lr]::
20848::$$$message_0166_0015_0002$$$::It wasn't there.[lr]::
20849::$$$message_0166_0015_0003$$$::There was nothing there!::
20850::$$$message_0166_0016_0000$$$::I can't let this sway me.[lr]::
20851::$$$message_0166_0016_0001$$$::It's way too late to let myself get sentimental now.[lr]::
20852::$$$message_0166_0016_0002$$$::Remembering it won't change the past.[lr]::
20853::$$$message_0166_0016_0003$$$::I can't allow myself to take these mistaken feelings and illusions, and arrange them into something beautiful.[lr]::
20854::$$$message_0166_0016_0004$$$::I accept things for what they are.[lr]::
20855::$$$message_0166_0016_0005$$$::Don't let a sense of nostalgia trick you into thinking that what isn't mine belongs to me.::
20856::$$$message_0166_0017_0000$$$::You're proud of the fact that you have nothing.[lr]::
20857::$$$message_0166_0017_0001$$$::Nothingness gives you meaning.[lr]::
20858::$$$message_0166_0017_0002$$$::Just because you fabricate something that doesn't exist won't change the fact that you were a pointless sacrifice.[lr]::
20859::$$$message_0166_0017_0003$$$::...Ah.[lr]::
20860::$$$message_0166_0017_0004$$$::Still, I'm pretty sure...::
20861::$$$message_0166_0018_0000$$$::   [wait canskip=0 time=1000]I'm pretty sure that there was never anything here...[lr]::
20862::$$$message_0166_0018_0001$$$::But does that really mean I didn't [font italic=true]hope[font italic=false] it meant something?::
20863::$$$message_0166_0019_0000$$$::The hymn is over before I realize it.[lr]::
20864::$$$message_0166_0019_0001$$$::I'm afraid it didn't give me the vigor I hoped for.[lr]::
20865::$$$message_0166_0019_0002$$$::And, once again, I realize Caren's standing in front of me.[lr]::
20866::$$$message_0166_0019_0003$$$::...Mrgh. I know I'm the one who insisted, but maybe she wants something from me, too.::
20867::$$$message_0166_0020_0000$$$::"I thought you weren't going to come here again."[lr]::
20868::$$$message_0166_0020_0001$$$::"Same. I wonder why. It was just a sudden whim. I thought it'd make me feel better, but I'm even more tired now."::
20869::$$$message_0166_0021_0000$$$::"...You told me to keep playing. Was it not to your liking?"::
20870::$$$message_0166_0022_0000$$$::"Mm? Well, I can't complain about your skill.[lr]::
20871::$$$message_0166_0022_0001$$$::Honestly, I'm impressed you can move as much as you can with all those bandages. Wait. Are you actually some kinda organ virtuoso?"::
20872::$$$message_0166_0023_0000$$$::"I pride myself in not falling behind others. Refining my strong points is a hobby of mine."[lr]::
20873::$$$message_0166_0023_0001$$$::"That's unusually confident for you... Oh, so you're a good organ player."[lr]::
20874::$$$message_0166_0023_0002$$$::I made a mistake.[lr]::
20875::$$$message_0166_0023_0003$$$::I was just listening to it lightheartedly like one would at a school arts festival. I wonder what would happen if I said that out loud.::
20876::$$$message_0166_0024_0000$$$::"I'm glad you understand.[lr]::
20877::$$$message_0166_0024_0001$$$::While we're on the topic, I'd like to know what exactly about it you didn't like."::
20878::$$$message_0166_0025_0000$$$::"What exactly? It made me fall asleep.[lr]::
20879::$$$message_0166_0025_0001$$$::I'm not asking for stage lighting, but you could at least [font italic=true]try[font italic=false] to make it more exciting.[lr]::
20880::$$$message_0166_0025_0002$$$::Also, that totally passive playing style is so boring. I wanna hear some real punk action. Y'know, something you could get so into that you'd end up kicking the keyboard."[lr]::
20881::$$$message_0166_0025_0003$$$::I couldn't ask for a better cacophony.::
20882::$$$message_0166_0026_0000$$$::"...That sounds more like the fault of the song, not the player.[lr]::
20883::$$$message_0166_0026_0001$$$::Perhaps the listener has poor taste, as well."[lr]::
20884::$$$message_0166_0026_0002$$$::"Gah. So you're saying you got a tough crowd?"::
20885::$$$message_0166_0027_0000$$$::"Unspeakably so. I can hardly find the words to express it."::
20886::$$$message_0166_0028_0000$$$::"Ngh..."[lr]::
20887::$$$message_0166_0028_0001$$$::I suppress a laugh.[lr]::
20888::$$$message_0166_0028_0002$$$::I thought she was hard to read, but it turns out I can get these reactions out of her when I poke at her pride.::
20889::$$$message_0166_0029_0000$$$::"What?"[lr]::
20890::$$$message_0166_0029_0001$$$::"Oh, just holding in my feelings.[lr]::
20891::$$$message_0166_0029_0002$$$::I bet you were a pretty unruly child. Your music teacher must've had a hell of a time teaching you."::
20892::$$$message_0166_0030_0000$$$::"...Please don't judge me by your standards.[lr]::
20893::$$$message_0166_0030_0001$$$::Besides, I already told you how I was raised.[lr]::
20894::$$$message_0166_0030_0002$$$::Wouldn't you assume that I taught myself during my isolation?"::
20895::$$$message_0166_0031_0000$$$::"Hm? I bet you at least had a teacher.[lr]::
20896::$$$message_0166_0031_0001$$$::Your sound follows a discipline. It carries the convictions of countless musicians, passed down through generations.[lr]::
20897::$$$message_0166_0031_0002$$$::You're not playing that organ just for yourself, right?[lr]::
20898::$$$message_0166_0031_0003$$$::It's supposed to be a universal sort of music that brings people together."::
20899::$$$message_0166_0032_0000$$$::You can only learn [font italic=true]skills[font italic=false] on your own.[lr]::
20900::$$$message_0166_0032_0001$$$::A prodigy can't suddenly create ideals that transcend the ages.[lr]::
20901::$$$message_0166_0032_0002$$$::If one compares a genius talent to a flower blooming on a large tree,[lr]::
20902::$$$message_0166_0032_0003$$$::then those who shine through their lineage are the trunk and branches that nurture the tree.::
20903::$$$message_0166_0033_0000$$$::"Even before that, having someone teach you is the fastest way to get better at something. I just assumed you took the rational approach over bending to social expectations.[lr]::
20904::$$$message_0166_0033_0001$$$::That's why I said you were a difficult child.[lr]::
20905::$$$message_0166_0033_0002$$$::I think you're the kind of person who will do everything you can to get something you really like."::
20906::$$$message_0166_0034_0000$$$::"...I disagree with your assessment.[lr]::
20907::$$$message_0166_0034_0001$$$::I was provided with the time and instruction to learn music, as a special exception. Is there a problem with that?"::
20908::$$$message_0166_0035_0000$$$::"See? The way you don't get discouraged when someone's upset at you, the way it doesn't hurt you, means that at your core, there's something that other people can't move.[lr]::
20909::$$$message_0166_0035_0001$$$::Don't tell me that isn't true.[lr]::
20910::$$$message_0166_0035_0002$$$::[shock vmax=20 time=400 count=-2]Honestly, you priests and nuns are all so shameless."[cacheimage storage=カレン修道服無帽04e(中)][wvs][chgfg textoff=0 pos=c time=300 storage=カレン修道服無帽04e(中)]::
20911::$$$message_0166_0036_0000$$$::I snicker.[lr]::
20912::$$$message_0166_0036_0001$$$::...Huh. I wonder what's got me in such a good mood all of a sudden.[lr]::
20913::$$$message_0166_0036_0002$$$::I'm not sure if I'm enjoying this or just being uppity with her, but I'm on some kinda emotional high.::
20914::$$$message_0166_0037_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
20915::$$$message_0166_0037_0001$$$::On the other hand, Caren's gone stiff.[lr]::
20916::$$$message_0166_0037_0002$$$::Looks like I struck a nerve.::
20917::$$$message_0166_0038_0000$$$::"Do I...really seem that shameless to you?"[lr]::
20918::$$$message_0166_0038_0001$$$::"Yeah. You'd give the guy you replaced a run for his money."[lr]::
20919::$$$message_0166_0038_0002$$$::"..."::
20920::$$$message_0166_0039_0000$$$::She seems distant, as if searching for the right words.[lr]::
20921::$$$message_0166_0039_0001$$$::It's an innocent side of her I haven't seen much of.[lr]::
20922::$$$message_0166_0039_0002$$$::Maybe my rational mind is slightly giving way to my excitement.[lr]::
20923::$$$message_0166_0039_0003$$$::All at once, desires I've pretended not to notice [wt canskip=0][fg nowait=1 textoff=0 left=0 index=2000 top=130 time=300 storage=オルガン04]send my heart pounding.[wt canskip=0][current withback=false]::
20924::$$$message_0166_0040_0000$$$::"Nngh...!"[lr]::
20925::$$$message_0166_0040_0001$$$::There's a faint sound, like a plastic bag tearing.[lr]::
20926::$$$message_0166_0040_0002$$$::I smell the odor of blood coming from beneath her robe.[wm canskip=0]::
20927::$$$message_0166_0041_0000$$$::"Huh? You on your period?"[lr]::
20928::$$$message_0166_0041_0001$$$::"...My wounds opened. I'm so sorry, um..."[wm canskip=0]::
20929::$$$message_0166_0042_0000$$$::"Oh yeah, I'll move back one seat. Sorry, that was completely my fault."[lr]::
20930::$$$message_0166_0042_0001$$$::I get up and move to a seat further in the back.[lr]::
20931::$$$message_0166_0042_0002$$$::The smell of blood fades slightly at this distance.::
20932::$$$message_0166_0043_0000$$$::"You've got it tough, huh? Still patrolling the town at night even while with open injuries.[lr]::
20933::$$$message_0166_0043_0001$$$::...Oh, right. You have to come find me on the fourth night."::
20934::$$$message_0166_0044_0000$$$::"...That's correct. Until this reenactment of the Holy Grail War ends, I must be in town on the fourth night.[lr]::
20935::$$$message_0166_0044_0001$$$::That is not the only reason I'm tired, of course.[lr]::
20936::$$$message_0166_0044_0002$$$::...Lately, I've begun doing something similar to exorcising demons."[lr]::
20937::$$$message_0166_0044_0003$$$::"Huh."::
20938::$$$message_0166_0045_0000$$$::I grunt absentmindedly.[lr]::
20939::$$$message_0166_0045_0001$$$::To be blunt, my hackles aren't coming down anytime soon. Certainly not just because the smell of blood isn't as strong.[wt canskip=0][current withback=false]::
20940::$$$message_0166_0046_0000$$$::I can see the white bandages she's using to hide her wounds.[lr]::
20941::$$$message_0166_0046_0001$$$::If I hold her down, her shoulders and thin arms would be liable to break.[lr]::
20942::$$$message_0166_0046_0002$$$::I bet that bloody, pale stomach would taste like the sweetest skewered fish in season.[wm canskip=0]::
20943::$$$message_0166_0047_0000$$$::"Umm. How's the exorcism going?"::
20944::$$$message_0166_0048_0000$$$::"Not well at all, I'm afraid.[lr]::
20945::$$$message_0166_0048_0001$$$::I've completed many exorcisms to date, but if I'm being honest, it's the first time I've encountered a case like this."::
20946::$$$message_0166_0049_0000$$$::"Huh. Sounds tough."[lr]::
20947::$$$message_0166_0049_0001$$$::Crimson begins to speckle her bandages.[lr]::
20948::$$$message_0166_0049_0002$$$::It's captivating. [wait canskip=0 time=400]Raw. [wait canskip=0 time=400]All this time I thought she was like a doll, but she's plenty raw.::
20949::$$$message_0166_0050_0000$$$::"If I had to rate the strength of this demon, it would be in the bottom tier.[lr]::
20950::$$$message_0166_0050_0001$$$::But there's something different about it this time that's throwing me off.[lr]::
20951::$$$message_0166_0050_0002$$$::...Because this demon is strict with me."[cacheimage storage=カレン修道服無帽05d(中),i言峰教会礼拝堂][wvs][rep textoff=0 fliplr=0 storages=カレン修道服無帽05d(中) time=600 flipud=0 poss=c bg=i言峰教会礼拝堂 indexes=1000][stopdash]::
20952::$$$message_0166_0051_0000$$$::"Huh? Aren't all demons mean sons of bitches?"::
20953::$$$message_0166_0052_0000$$$::"No. Demons are generally kind.[lr]::
20954::$$$message_0166_0052_0001$$$::Whatever the result, they are fictitious entities who understand the pain that humans face and try to take it away. Depending on how you look at it, they might even seem like allies of humanity.[lr]::
20955::$$$message_0166_0052_0002$$$::What they never do is criticize humans."::
20956::$$$message_0166_0053_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
20957::$$$message_0166_0053_0001$$$::I can only take it as an invitation.[lr]::
20958::$$$message_0166_0053_0002$$$::The pose she makes as she prays. Her interlocked fingers. [move textoff=0 time=250 path=(0,0,180)(0,0,0) storage=42死のイメージ accel=0]Her scarred body, I...[lr]::
20959::$$$message_0166_0053_0003$$$::It reminds me of...[wm canskip=0][lr]::
20960::$$$message_0166_0053_0004$$$::But she's neither offering those to God nor the Devil.[lr]::
20961::$$$message_0166_0053_0005$$$::She does nothing, and takes in all things as they are.[lr]::
20962::$$$message_0166_0053_0006$$$::A convenient sacrifice who accepts unwarranted blame.::
20963::$$$message_0166_0054_0000$$$::"...Hah..."[lr]::
20964::$$$message_0166_0054_0001$$$::Not good. I need to snap out of this.[lr]::
20965::$$$message_0166_0054_0002$$$::This impulse is going to break my shell.::
20966::$$$message_0166_0055_0000$$$::"What's wrong? You look unwell."[lr]::
20967::$$$message_0166_0055_0001$$$::"Nah, just a little anemic.[lr]::
20968::$$$message_0166_0055_0002$$$::Back to what you were saying. This first-time case of yours, is it interesting?"::
20969::$$$message_0166_0056_0000$$$::"Not at all. It's been nothing but unexpected. Irritating, if anything.[lr]::
20970::$$$message_0166_0056_0001$$$::...I think I'm beginning to tire of it.[lr]::
20971::$$$message_0166_0056_0002$$$::I decided to take it up, but it's looking like it might be beyond my help. Do you mind if I give up now?"[lr]::
20972::$$$message_0166_0056_0003$$$::"I don't really care. You should do what you wanna do."::
20973::$$$message_0166_0057_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
20974::$$$message_0166_0057_0001$$$::"What? I'm not calling you irresponsible for getting bored."[lr]::
20975::$$$message_0166_0057_0002$$$::"I know.[lr]::
20976::$$$message_0166_0057_0003$$$::...[wait canskip=0 time=1000][say storage=karen05_kar_0241 name=カレン]See? You [font italic=true]are[font italic=false] strict with me."::
20977::$$$message_0166_0058_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
20978::$$$message_0166_0058_0001$$$::That's the first time anyone's ever called me strict.[lr]::
20979::$$$message_0166_0058_0002$$$::I seem to remember her calling me either impatient or patient... But which one of us was which?::
20980::$$$message_0166_0059_0000$$$::...I'm still having trouble snapping out of it.[lr]::
20981::$$$message_0166_0059_0001$$$::This time, she's a challenge.[lr]::
20982::$$$message_0166_0059_0002$$$::Do her golden eyes see me, the real me?[lr]::
20983::$$$message_0166_0059_0003$$$::I can't believe that my cocoon has started to crack after only four meetings.::
20984::$$$message_0166_0060_0000$$$::"Don't tell me you took that seriously?"[lr]::
20985::$$$message_0166_0060_0001$$$::"Huh...?"[lr]::
20986::$$$message_0166_0060_0002$$$::I look up, being mentioned.::
20987::$$$message_0166_0061_0000$$$::"...I apologize. I just wanted to tease you a little, too.[lr]::
20988::$$$message_0166_0061_0001$$$::Don't worry. I won't call it quits halfway.[lr]::
20989::$$$message_0166_0061_0002$$$::I took it upon myself to show you the way, after all."::
20990::$$$message_0166_0062_0000$$$::"...Yeah. Our relationship was supposed to be that of exchanging information, wasn't it? I totally forgot because you haven't been helpful at all since the second time."::
20991::$$$message_0166_0063_0000$$$::"That's because you keep bringing up irrelevant topics. If you had gotten straight to the point, I would have given you my opinions."[lr]::
20992::$$$message_0166_0063_0001$$$::"Is that so?[lr]::
20993::$$$message_0166_0063_0002$$$::But..."::
20994::$$$message_0166_0064_0000$$$::I have nothing else to ask.[lr]::
20995::$$$message_0166_0064_0001$$$::Shirou Emiya and Caren Hortensia's relationship completely concluded after our third meeting.::
20996::$$$message_0166_0065_0000$$$::"...There's pretty much nothing left to ask anymore. Sorry.[lr]::
20997::$$$message_0166_0065_0001$$$::About what you said earlier, I guess I wouldn't mind if you gave up now.[lr]::
20998::$$$message_0166_0065_0002$$$::You should move on and find a new demon to hunt."::
20999::$$$message_0166_0066_0000$$$::That's my conclusion.[lr]::
21000::$$$message_0166_0066_0001$$$::Soon, our relationship will end.::
21001::$$$message_0166_0067_0000$$$::"This may be a silly question, but are you truly fine with that?"[lr]::
21002::$$$message_0166_0067_0001$$$::"Of course I am. I've done a lot to make things turn out this way."[lr]::
21003::$$$message_0166_0067_0002$$$::"But is that your own will? Why do you want to put an end to this wish?"::
21004::$$$message_0166_0068_0000$$$::"That's obvious, too. Because I'm Shirou Emiya. I've always wanted to save someone, at least once."[lr]::
21005::$$$message_0166_0068_0001$$$::I'm certain.[lr]::
21006::$$$message_0166_0068_0002$$$::My second answer was genuinely from the heart.[clfg textoff=0 pos=all rule=シャッター左から time=400]::
21007::$$$message_0166_0069_0000$$$::I get up.[lr]::
21008::$$$message_0166_0069_0001$$$::Having managed to say that, I want to believe that our time together meant something.::
21009::$$$message_0166_0070_0000$$$::   Wait.[lr]::
21010::$$$message_0166_0070_0001$$$::I can't stay with you anymore.[lr]::
21011::$$$message_0166_0070_0002$$$::I head outside, not slowing my step.::
21012::$$$message_0166_0071_0000$$$::   You're nothing. As long as there is something unborn, something unknown, you'll keep existing.[lr]::
21013::$$$message_0166_0071_0001$$$::There isn't much time left.[lr]::
21014::$$$message_0166_0071_0002$$$::I just need to solve this quickly.::
21015::$$$message_0166_0072_0000$$$::  But once everything is born, you'll have nowhere to go. The closer these days come to an end, the more you lose your radiance.[lr]::
21016::$$$message_0166_0072_0001$$$::I'm not losing it. I...[lr]::
21017::$$$message_0166_0072_0002$$$::   You'll lose interest in the world and return to nothingness.[lr]::
21018::$$$message_0166_0072_0003$$$::I'm just going back to the shape I used to be. The way I should be.[nolr]::
920795::$$$message_9166_0000_0001$$$::No unfinished business at all. Not for Shirou Emiya.[r]::
920861::$$$message_9166_0018_0000$$$::I'm pretty sure that there was never anything here...[r]::
